# Shell scripts run under bash (Linux / CI) — they MUST have LF line endings, or
# the shebang breaks with `env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`. Force LF so a
# Windows checkout (or an autocrlf clone) never introduces CRLF into them.
*.sh text eol=lf
ci/linux/** text eol=lf

# Windows PowerShell scripts are fine either way; leave them native.
*.ps1 text
